[PLAN] feat.mm.graph_space: 
The graph space holds the Programs and graph versions of the context, and the collector of
run-time values sweeps it: a Program is reached by the function values made in it, a graph by
the Programs that hold it, and what nothing reaches is freed. 4000 calls of grad build 4000
gradient Programs (3 graphs each, about 12 MB if all were kept); with the graph space asked to
collect at 1 MB the high-water mark of the space stays a small multiple of what is alive.

